#: lookandfeeltab_kcm.cpp:86 main.cpp:332
msgid ""
"<h1>Panel</h1> Here you can configure the KDE panel (also referred to as "
"'kicker'). This includes options like the position and size of the panel, as "
"well as its hiding behavior and its looks.<p> Note that you can also access "
"some of these options directly by clicking on the panel, e.g. dragging it with "
"the left mouse button or using the context menu on right mouse button click. "
"This context menu also offers you manipulation of the panel's buttons and "
"applets."
msgstr ""
